 * DEPRECATED: This file is no longer used as of the ritual casting system migration.
 *
 * The powerWords speech listener system has been replaced with the `.r` command.
 * Priests (Sacerdote), Shamans, and Druids now use `.r <spellname>` to cast memorized rituals.
 *
 * This file is kept for reference only. It is no longer started by logon.src.
 * The continuous speech listener was resource-intensive and has been removed in favor
 * of the command-based system that mages already use.
 *
 * See: pkg/systems/spells/commands/player/r.src for the replacement system
 *
 * Migration date: 2025-10-16
 * Last functional version: Git commit before druid/spells branch merge
 */

